1
00:00:12,456 --> 00:00:18,596
Alors, le Japon ? Les gens sont très polis, non ?
So, Japan? People are very polite, aren't they?

2
00:00:18,696 --> 00:00:24,644
Oui ! Au Japon, on ne serre pas la main, on s'incline.
Yes! In Japan, you don't shake hands, you bow.

3
00:00:24,744 --> 00:00:29,828
En France, on fait la bise, mais seulement entre amis.
In France, we kiss on the cheek, but only between friends.

4
00:00:29,928 --> 00:00:34,676
Et il est normal d'enlever ses chaussures avant d'entrer chez quelqu'un.
And it's normal to take your shoes off before going into someone's home.

5
00:00:34,776 --> 00:00:40,700
Chez nous, on les garde souvent. Ça dépend des familles.
At our place, we often keep them on. It depends on the family.

6
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:45,860
Dans chaque pays, il faut respecter les habitudes des autres.
In every country, you have to respect other people's habits.
